        <mxCell id="v24" value="&lt;b&gt;Separate attributes, deliberately:&lt;/b&gt; BorrowingTransaction.lifecycleState (where the loan is) and Assessment.assuranceState (what the evidence says) &amp;#8212; e.g. HELD_FOR_REVIEW with REVIEW_RECOMMENDED (ES-04). &lt;b&gt;Deliberately left out of iteration 1:&lt;/b&gt; chat thread and messages (G1), notifications (G3), calendar blocks (B2), listing photos, counter-offer, appeal (modelled as later ModeratorDecisions). &amp;#9670; composition: events live and die with their transaction. Colours: &lt;span style='background:#E3EEF9'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='background:#FDEBDD'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='background:#EEE5F6'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="916" width="1860" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
